<title>FRANCE: SocGen says placed Alcatel shares.</title>
<headline>SocGen says placed Alcatel shares.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Ste Generale said it placed the shares in Alcatel Alsthom it had bought from Italy's Fiat SpA with institutional investors.</p>
<p>Fiat said earlier on Thursday that it sold its 1.9 percent Alactel stake for some two billion francs to SocGen.</p>
</text>
